---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../../config';

const contactEmail = siteConfig.tipEmail;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for my-monasterevin.ie — how we handle community and business listing data."
>
  <PageHero
    title="Privacy Policy"
    subtitle="Last updated: June 1, 2026"
    tone="teal"
  />

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="section-inner !pt-10">
      <div class="prose-content mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        <h2>1. Our Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          my-monasterevin.ie is committed to protecting the privacy of our local community. Because
          we operate as a public information hub, we minimize data collection to the absolute
          essentials.
        </p>

        <h2>2. What We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We do not use tracking cookies, analytics scripts that track individual user behaviour, or
          advertising trackers. We do not require users to sign in or create accounts, meaning we do
          not store personal data for general visitors.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Business Listings &amp; Data</h2>
        <p>
          We maintain a directory of local businesses to provide value to our community.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Information collection:</strong> We only collect and publish information that a
          business owner or representative explicitly submits to us for the purpose of being listed
          (e.g. business name, contact details, address, or service description).
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Consent:</strong> By submitting your information to my-monasterevin.ie, you consent
          to have that specific information displayed publicly on our website.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Data accuracy:</strong> We rely on the information provided by the business. If
          your details change, please contact us at{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a> so we can update them.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Your Right to Removal (The "Right to be Forgotten")</h2>
        <p>
          We respect your control over your information. If you are a business owner and would like
          your listing modified or completely removed from our site, please contact us at{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          We commit to processing all take-down requests within 3–5 business days. Once processed,
          the information will be permanently deleted from our live site and our internal records.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our site may contain links to other websites (e.g. local government pages or business
          websites). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those external sites. We
          encourage you to read their privacy policies if you choose to visit them.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Updates to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy occasionally to reflect changes in our site structure. Any
          changes will be posted here with an updated "Last Updated" date.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this policy or need to request the removal of a listing,
          please contact us at:{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
